 "2025-03-02T11:58:54.647Z", "status": "PB", "cover_img": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/24/Osowiec_fortress_church.jpg/1280px-Osowiec_fortress_church.jpg", "img_description": "Osowiec Fortress. Fortress Church. The parade on the occasion of the distribution St. George's crosses. January 24, 1915"}}]
